  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building territory, culture and identity for peace &#x2013; Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be carried out by NRC and Fundaci&#xF3;n Solidaria Arquidiocesana in four departments at the Pacific Coast (Nari&#xF1;o, Cauca, Choc&#xF3; and Antioquia). The project seeks to strengthen the capacities and initiatives of the communities and ethno-territorial organisations in the Colombian Pacific region, in order to respond adequately to the humanitarian crisis in this area. Simultaneously, the agreement aims to strengthen local conflict resolution mechanisms and capacity building of ethnic-territorial organisations and social leaders to exercise and protect their ethnic/territorial rights.</narrative>
  </description>
